Fatty acids among all Omega-3 are Eicosapentaenoic acid (EPA) and Docosahexaenoic acid (DHA). EPA has a powerful anti-inflammatory effect and, according to clinical researches, can reduce the risk of heart disease, rheumatism and even cancer. At the same time, DHA plays an important role in heart and brain healt h. According to WHO recommendations, it is necessary to consume at least 500 mg of Omega-3 (EPA + DHA) per day. The optimal ratio between EPA and DHA is 4:3. 
Each Omega-3 Cardio Max capsule contains 800 mg of Omega-3 (400 mg - EPA, 300 mg - DHA).
Therefore, taking one capsule per day fully meets WHO recommendation and ensures the body with Omega-3 in the optimal ratio!
